For any nonnegative triangular array \(g\), any \(I<J\) with \(g_{I,J}>0\), and
\[
A=\{[a,e]:a\le I,\ e\ge J,\ g_{i,j}>0\ \forall a\le i\le I,\ J\le j\le e\},
\]
one has
\[
\sum_{[a,e]\in A}
(g_{a,e}-g_{a,e+1}-g_{a-1,e}+g_{a-1,e+1})
\ge g_{I,J}>0.
\]

